# `collision`: a variant written bare where an associated type's index stands, declared by
# two modules this file reaches (`Watch.Viewer` and `Shop.Viewer`), is never one of them
# picked silently. Found by the step 3 build on the tally, whose `Viewer` met the library's
# `FileRole.Viewer` and was read as the library's, so `Answer (Tallied o) Viewer` never
# reduced. Expected text derived by hand.
# Written by Claude on the claude-self-hosting branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
mod Watch
mod Shop
use Watch.*
use Shop.*

Told: fn Told Watching Viewer -> Nat
fn Told n = n
